@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour: Refuse a quote request for a platform
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Member" as actor
box "Backend: Jubilee API" #D1FADF
  participant "RequestsController" as controller
end box
box "Backend: Jubilee Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "RequestQuoteCommandHandler" as handler
end box
box "Backend: Jubilee Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Jubilee database" as db
end box
note over actor : No screen offers a quote on a platform (L2-254 AC3); the request is sent by hand
actor -> controller : POST a quote request naming the slug of a platform
controller -> handler : Send RequestQuoteCommand with the member of the session
handler -> db : Public listing by slug
db --> handler : Listing, Kind Platform
handler --> controller : ConflictException NOT_OFFERED, before the fields are checked
controller --> actor : 409 ProblemDetails with code NOT_OFFERED (L2-248 AC5)
note over handler, db : No Request, no notification and no e-mail is created
@enduml
